---
title: SEQ-01 — Account access and profile (UC-01–UC-04)
config:
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Reader or Teacher
    participant App as Itqan App
    participant IdP as Identity Provider
    participant Account as Account Service
    participant DB as Database
    alt UC-01 Register
        User->>App: Choose Reader or Teacher, enter name and email
        opt Teacher
            User->>App: Enter required school name
        end
        alt Required field missing
            App-->>User: Show field error, no account created
        else Valid fields
            App->>IdP: Register credentials
            alt Email already used or provider unavailable
                IdP-->>App: Reject or unavailable
                App-->>User: Explain failure, no account created
            else Identity created
                IdP-->>App: Identity subject
                App->>Account: registerOrUpdateAccount(type, profile, subject)
                Account->>DB: Store Account, TeacherDetail only for Teacher
                Note over DB: Account type is fixed, language defaults to Arabic, no password stored
                DB-->>Account: Account created
                Account-->>App: Reader or Teacher account
                App-->>User: Open account-type area, Teacher gets Al-Mu'allim
            end
        end
    else UC-02 Login
        User->>App: Sign in
        App->>IdP: Authenticate credentials
        alt Wrong credentials or provider unavailable
            IdP-->>App: Reject or unavailable
            App-->>User: Stay logged out, explain failure
        else Authenticated
            IdP-->>App: Identity subject
            App->>Account: Get account for subject
            Account->>DB: Read fixed account type
            DB-->>Account: Reader or Teacher
            Account-->>App: Account area and profile
            App-->>User: Open correct area
            opt User requests wrong-role screen or data
                App-->>User: Deny access
            end
        end
    else UC-04 Manage profile
        User->>App: Open profile
        App->>Account: Get profile
        Account->>DB: Read Account and conditional TeacherDetail
        DB-->>Account: Name, email, language, optional school name
        Account-->>App: Profile, email read-only here
        App-->>User: Show profile
        User->>App: Edit name or language, Teacher may edit school name
        alt Empty required name
            App-->>User: Refuse change, nothing saved
        else Email or credential change
            App-->>User: Use Identity Provider
        else Valid profile change
            App->>Account: registerOrUpdateAccount(profile changes)
            Account->>DB: Save name, ar/en language, optional school name
            DB-->>Account: Saved
            Account-->>App: Updated profile
            App-->>User: Apply language immediately
        end
    else UC-03 Logout
        alt User chooses Logout
            User->>App: Choose Logout
        else Inactivity timeout expires
            App->>App: Expire login session while no recitation is active
        end
        Note over App: Inactivity timeout is suppressed during active recitation
        opt Explicit logout during recitation
            App->>App: End session as interrupted via SEQ-03
        end
        App->>IdP: Logout
        IdP-->>App: Login session ended
        App-->>User: Show login screen, deny protected data
    end
